### Register
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"testersson","password":"123123"}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"testersson","password":"123123"}

### Get posts 
GET http://localhost:3000/api/posts

### Create post 
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Test","content":"Hello",}

### Create post with image (simpler)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/posts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Test Post
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

My content
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="postDate"

2026-06-16
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< /home/txmpold/Pictures/tree.png
--MyBoundary--

### Update post 
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/posts/{{POST_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"New","content":"Updated","author":"<AUTHOR_ID>"}